$face_enhancer — neural x4 face detail enhancement

SUMMARY
  Runs the DeepFaceLab FaceEnhancer model on each aligned face image in
  images[] and replaces them with enhanced PNG crops. PyTorch implementation
  in .venvs/media (GPU when CUDA torch is available).

SYNTAX
  $face_enhancer
  $face_enhancer(preserve_size=1, is_tanh=0)

INPUT
  images[] — face crops (typically from $face).

OUTPUT
  images[] — enhanced face PNGs.

ARGUMENTS
  preserve_size=1 — keep output the same size as input (default).
  is_tanh=0 — set to 1 if pixels are already in [-1, 1].

MODELS
  models/face/FaceEnhancer.npy

SETUP
  .venvs/media. AH_FACE_GPU=0 forces CPU.

EXAMPLE
  @hq: @faces -> $face(size=512) -> $face_enhancer

PROMPT-CONSUMING
  No.
